WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:04.971 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.741
-Hello.
Dude, these look great.

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:08.975
-Yeah, we should post that.

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.376
-What's up, my dudes?
-What's up, du--

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:11.745
Oh, my God!
-Oh, no!

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.813
-What happened?
-Oh, sorry I'm late.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.749
Got boned by the subway.
Damn you, C-train.

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:19.786
Um, how y'all doing?
-No, dude, your face.

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:21.153
Did you get Botox?

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:22.889
-Oh, you guys can tell?
-Yes!

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:23.990
-Yeah, just got a little
touch-up.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.224
-What?
-So this is intentional?

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:26.493
Not an accident?
-Yeah, I figured if we're

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:27.894
going to be on camera
a little more,

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:29.262
might as well look my best.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.930
-Ben, you know I love you.
-Love you, too.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.398
-You look like you drowned.

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:34.567
-I feel like I'm at your wake.
You look embalmed.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.469
-I asked for the Chalamet.
Is that coming through?

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.070
-No!
-I like it, man.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.539
I paid top dollar
for this thing.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:40.740
-How much?
-150 bucks.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.174
-That's not enough.
-Not enough?

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:44.444
-For full-face Botox?
-That sucks.

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:47.046
I wish there was an undo button
for this thing. [ Laughs ]

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:49.515
-Your face isn't even moving
when you laugh, dude.

00:00:49.515 --> 00:00:51.817
This is so bad.
-I'm sorry. What did you do?

00:00:51.817 --> 00:00:54.187
-Oh, my God.
-What is with your fingers?

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.488
-Oh, yeah.
I got some work done myself.

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:57.590
-You got longer fingers?
-Oh, my God.

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.225
We are not making this
about my fingers.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:00.659
-Wait, wait, you extended them?

00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:02.494
-You know how many YouTube
comments there were

00:01:02.494 --> 00:01:03.763
about how short
they were before.

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:05.231
-Well, now, you look like
the Babadook.

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.565
-Wow, Martin.
How about you go shh?

00:01:06.565 --> 00:01:08.668
-Don't touch my mouth!
-Stop!

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.302
-You look like
"Pan's Labyrinth."

00:01:10.302 --> 00:01:12.004
-Do I?
-Do this.

00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:13.506
That's Pan.
-Oh, yeah.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:14.940
Well, yeah, sure. Fine.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.209
But these fingers rock.
I feel more confident.

00:01:17.209 --> 00:01:18.744
I play guitar easier.

00:01:18.744 --> 00:01:20.947
I can do cool stuff
like "West Side!"

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:23.149
-I got Botox. I look good.
-You know what?

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.417
Should I get some work done on
my face?

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:26.218
-No, you don't need it.
-I know.

00:01:26.218 --> 00:01:28.521
I'm talking about
my second face.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.523 line:0%
-Ew! Oh, my God!
-What the hell?

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:32.192
-What is that?
-I know. I know.

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:34.427
He needs a nose job.
-No, what the hell is it?

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.062
Does it talk?
-He used to,

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.197
but then I think he died.
-Oh!

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:39.799
-Okay, this is so toxic.

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:42.468
Can we all agree that we're
beautiful on the inside?

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:44.637
-I guess so.
-Yeah.

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:46.573
-[ Deep voice ] I agree.
-Who said that?

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:48.774
-It was me.
You guys are beautiful.

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:50.510
[ All screaming ]

